 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"I hate to ask this, but I'm achy and wrung out, barely keeping food down. Will you help me?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"Rest and clean water aren't cutting it. If this turns, I'm no good to anyone — can't haul, can't hunt, can't watch. I need someone who knows what they're doing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "Another crack. The telling doesn't hold together anymore."
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"They're already drifting away. \"Later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"You're a good listener, you know that?\" A tired smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"My wound needs a second pair of hands. Will you help me clean it?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"It's getting worse, not better. If it festers I'm no good to anyone — can't haul, can't hunt, can't watch. Just clean it out and wrap it tight.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "The ground remembers."
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"And... scene. Good talk.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "They fill the quiet. \"Anyway — where was I?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 9,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"About this wound — I still haven't found anyone. Any chance?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "The ground remembers."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "As I said — Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "They glance at the fire, then back. The quiet doesn't seem to bother them."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "They settle — not warm, not cold. Just two people talking."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Right. I get it.\" A beat — and then the subject is closed. They won't raise it again."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "Names, named."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Well. My social battery is officially dead.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Okay. I'll manage on my own.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"...Actually, forget it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Never mind the sickness I'm fighting — we got it handled. Thanks anyway.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "Done — their story has a crack in it now."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "You don't answer. The quiet turns pointed."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "The air goes tight. Their eyes narrow, just slightly."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"We never finished talking about that favor — we got cut off, 7 days back. 'The air goes tight. Their eyes narrow, just slightly.'\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "The easy manner evaporates. What's left is watching you back."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Oh — that?\" Cheryl laughs, relieved. \"No, no, you've got it wrong — let me explain...\" And they do, and it makes sense, and you feel a little foolish for doubting them."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "Their eyes do the math before their mouth does. You can see the calculation happening."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"You're wrong.\" Too fast. Cheryl looks away. \"Just... drop it, okay?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Not right now. I've got my own things to handle.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "You show them Groundnut — where it grows, how to tell it apart. They nod slowly, committing it to memory. \"Good to know. Really good to know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Huh. I wouldn't have guessed that about you.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"...What's that supposed to mean?\" Their voice goes careful."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Okay. That's — I need a minute. A long minute.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Good — that favor, settled. Feels better said out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Can we talk?\" Alfredo sits down near you. \"Just... talk. Like people used to.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"The pantry's nearly bare. Will you forage with me tomorrow? Two pairs of eyes, twice the ground.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Another day like today and we're choosing who eats. I know the bitter leaf patch past the treeline — come with me and we'll fill packs before dark.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "There is no playable joint foraging outing yet. Giving food does not perform the promised outing."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"The Echo. They just... took you. Came back like nothing happened. It wasn't nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"...Fine. This had better be worth it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"I should go before I say something sincere.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 20,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  }
 ],
