  "deathBeat": [
   "d6: 🕯️ Eli Weiss is dead — a hushwolf. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging."
  ],
  "recoverHome": [
   "d7: That night, they bring Eli home. Nobody asks you to help carry; nobody has to. By morning the grave is dug by the fire, and the body is laid out beside it. The filling of it is yours."
  ],
  "vouch": [],
  "systemVoice": [
   "d7: SYSTEM: Neural interface stable. Text overlay enabled.",
   "d7: ⬢ SYSTEM: \"Neural depth 20. I can hold more of you now — ability slots: 2.\"",
   "d7: ◈ THE SPARK — something clicks. A trick Boris learned long ago suddenly has edges it never had. SYSTEM: \"ANOMALY: organic unit demonstrates pattern recognition. Slot capacity increased. We are taking notes.\" (Ability slots: 2)",
   "d7: SYSTEM: Oh! It has a NAME. You all love names.",
   "d7: SYSTEM: Identification complete. You are 0.3% less lost.",
   "d7: SYSTEM: Naming things. Very human. The audience approves.",
   "d7: SYSTEM: Catalogued. The Codex grows teeth.",
   "d7: SYSTEM: Naming things. Very human. The audience approves.",
   "d7: ⬢ SYSTEM: \"Neural depth 35. I can hold more of you now — ability slots: 3.\"",
   "d7: SYSTEM: Identification complete. You are 0.3% less lost.",
   "d7: SYSTEM: Oh! It has a NAME. You all love names.",
   "d8: SYSTEM: \"Perimeter violated! This is unprecedented! ...Is this unprecedented? Checking. Yes. Unprecedented.\"",
   "d8: SYSTEM: \"INTRUDER REPELLED. The pantry’s aroma is now classified as a defensive liability. The audience is chanting the defenders’ names. Fan clubs are forming. This is how it starts.\"",
   "d8: ◈ SYSTEM: \"RATINGS DIP. The audience wants STAKES — pointed ones. A PALISADE. Stockpile 14,000 kcal, 350 wood and 60 stone. Walls make such good television. You will thank us when the teeth come.\"",
   "d8: SYSTEM: Quest protocol integrated. Objectives will appear.",
   "d8: SYSTEM: Catalogued. The Codex grows teeth."
  ],
  "burialWindowSay": [
   "d7: That night, they bring Eli home. Nobody asks you to help carry; nobody has to. By morning the grave is dug by the fire, and the body is laid out beside it. The filling of it is yours.",
   "d7: 📻 \"Why do the small humans keep putting organic matter in their FACE-HOLES? We built you a fusion pellet! ...You BURIED it. WHY did you bury the pellet?!\"",
   "d9: You say a few words for them. Not a ceremony — just: you were here, and someone noticed you leaving. (-3 trauma)",
   "d9: You bury them. A marker, of sorts. The village will know where. (+4 trauma)",
   "d10: ◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+6 integration)",
   "d10: ◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+5 integration)",
   "d10: ◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+4 integration)"
